<!--
    GEOMETRY SOURCE, NOT A SHIPPED DRAWABLE. This lives outside app/src/main/res on purpose:
    swarm/tools/render_lens_art.py rasterises these paths into region masks and renders the
    lit WebP the lens actually uses (drawable-nodpi/lens_cowboy_*_art.webp). Edit the shape
    here, then re-run that tool — never hand-edit the .webp.
-->
<!--
    Handlebar mustache for Lens.Cowboy — see Lens.kt for the face-unit numbers.

    The silhouette is traced from the owner's reference at 5% column steps and fitted to within a
    few units of the measured top and bottom edges. The reference is already symmetric here, and
    tracing it is what fixed the first draft: drawn by eye, the philtrum notch and the centre arch
    both ran far too deep and the thing read as two separate blobs rather than one moustache.

    The 620x250 viewport is 442.9 units per face unit at the catalogue's 1.4-unit width, so the
    coordinates read as anatomy against a mouth anchored at the origin: the humps at y=1 stop at
    the nose base, the arch at y=80 clears the lip line by 0.16 units, and the lobes at y=248 hang
    beside the mouth corners rather than over them.

    One closed silhouette in one flat colour, as the reference draws it. The shape is the whole
    read at 56dp, so shading that would be invisible there is left out.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="310dp"
    android:height="125dp"
    android:viewportWidth="620"
    android:viewportHeight="250">

    <!--
        Left barb -> hump -> philtrum notch -> hump -> right barb along the top, then back along
        the underside: each tip tapers to an upswept point, each lobe hangs past the mouth corner,
        and the middle arches high so the wearer's lips stay readable.
    -->
    <path
        android:fillColor="#FF33261C"
        android:pathData="M2,190
            C30,226 50,213 62,213
            C86,213 100,150 124,95
            C144,42 166,14 186,11
            C208,8 232,1 248,1
            C272,1 296,12 310,23
            C324,12 348,1 372,1
            C388,1 412,8 434,11
            C454,14 476,42 496,95
            C520,150 534,213 558,213
            C570,213 590,226 618,190
            C600,225 580,246 558,248
            C538,250 516,246 496,238
            C472,228 452,205 434,175
            C414,144 392,115 372,97
            C352,84 330,80 310,80
            C290,80 268,84 248,97
            C228,115 206,144 186,175
            C168,205 148,228 124,238
            C104,246 82,250 62,248
            C40,246 20,225 2,190
            Z" />
